0299f68f38c1db80db76081a62b62de55b4c0a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 如图是在巴黎奥运会上,举重男子 61 公斤级比赛中,中国选手打破自己保持的抓举奥运会纪录,成功卫冕.下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f254e759ec1bbd301355f017dbf8e13327e6642df7612b48543d9fe8de9b3bc2.png","width":283,"height":190,"width_mm":33.18,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q03-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第3题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 运动员受到杠铃的压力是由于手臂发生形变而产生的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 在举起杠铃的过程中,地面对运动员做正功"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 在举起杠铃的过程中,杠铃对运动员的作用力始终等于杠铃重力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 手对杠铃的作用力与杠铃对手的作用力的方向始终相反"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q04","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f81477f7becbb81464165d8cf51ca4bf1c65138df3a20a260582125f0fe2a896","body":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 如图为我国研制的一种全新微型核能电池，可以实现五十年稳定安全自发电. 它利用镍核 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(_{28}^{63}\\mathrm{Ni}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" 同位素衰变成铜核 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(_{29}^{A}\\mathrm{Cu}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" 同位素, 释放的能量被半导体转换器吸收并转化为电能. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/936d4e33b41e25ccc33a21be56d436dd49cc1ff9cf3dbc595b50142a678d8a69.png","width":340,"height":224,"width_mm":39.9,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q04-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第4题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 镍核衰变产生的射线是 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 粒子流"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 温度越高, "},{"type":"math","value":"^{63}_{28}Ni"},{"type":"text","value":" 衰变成新核 "},{"type":"math","value":"^{A}_{29}Cu"},{"type":"text","value":" 的速度变快"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"^{63}_{28}Ni"},{"type":"text","value":" 核的结合能比 "},{"type":"math","value":"^{A}_{29}Cu"},{"type":"text","value":" 核的结合能小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 衰变中伴随产生的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":" 射线是由镍核跃迁发出的"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q05","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"234e0d957a87ffb5ede9555b81b0e2beee4aab5e800d3accef39ebdf97ec1511","body":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 我国未来将建立月球基地，并在绕月轨道上建造空间站。如图所示，关闭发动机的航天飞机仅在月球引力作用下沿椭圆轨道向月球靠近，并将在椭圆的近月点 B 处与空间站对接。已知空间站 C 绕月轨道半径为 r，周期为 T，引力常量为 G，月球的半径为 R，忽略月球自转。下列说法不正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/188b7ea61abf8c29a94e9d2cb1cbab32afa27d1dca7d79dce62b815153f9bb25.png","width":370,"height":213,"width_mm":43.47,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q05-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 月球的平均密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3\\pi r^{3}}{GT^{2}R^{3}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 月球表面的重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4\\pi^{2}r^{3}}{R^{2}T^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 要使对接成功，飞机在接近 B 点时必须减速"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 对接前航天飞机的加速度大于空间站的加速度"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q06","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"70b4afd55530b6d1d1bc25849c73851425e12d8a2c9a29f6a3ee842d688c4117","body":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 两不带电的空腔圆柱形导体相互接触, 点 P 位于空腔导体内部中心位置处. 接下去进行如图所示操作: 第 1 步在导体左端附近放置一正点电荷 Q; 第 2 步左右分开两空腔导体; 第 3 步移去电荷 Q. 该装置处在真空绝缘环境中, 绝缘支架未画出, 则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d867e36ed69953143f9a20134f716e36d011caeaf283583b6ba53d829a7bcefe.png","width":336,"height":176,"width_mm":39.48,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第1步\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/86fb54cdf13a75fdaa1fcd39eb885ded