rkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ca97f291ec36137b916dadddbc24730ebfabcbd40bba2cdc884f70df7d62c90c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 某同学设计了一款基于电容器的制动能量回收系统, 它能有效增加电动汽车的续航里程. 其工作原理为踩下驱动踏板时电池给电动机供电, 松开驱动踏板或踩下刹车踏板时发电机工作回收能量, 工作原理如图模型. 导线框 abcd 处在两磁极形成的辐射状磁场中, 导线框可在两金属半圆 A、D 内侧自由转动,且接触良好.则电动汽车在行驶过程中\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/184e07c9467f03f5068384fc0b8b357c90a6da6f27644dc62249022e76615269.png","width":298,"height":281,"width_mm":34.86,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q08-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第8题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 松开驱动踏板,电容器右板带负电"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 踩下驱动踏板,导线框将会顺时针转动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 松开驱动踏板或踩下刹车踏板,应该是接通开关1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 松开驱动踏板,半圆环 A、D 两端输出的是交流电"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q09","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"546ff1db411fd125bbfc67e8a890d7205bcf6b66a5e63bb2c40d923116523e62","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. 如图为中国女排在奥运会比赛的场景, 某次运动员将飞来的排球从 a 点水平击出, 球击中地面上的 b 点; 另一次将即将落地的排球从 a 点的正下方即 c 点斜向上击出, 也击中 b 点. 第二次排球运动的最高点 d 与 a 点等高, 且两轨迹交点恰好为排球网上端点 e. 已知排球网高 2.24 m, c 点到球网平面的水平距离为 3.36 m, 不计空气阻力, 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bbe22e9b87cb118c1672804005b70e7863689df992aa78daf817b95cfce0270d.png","width":358,"height":180,"width_mm":42,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q09-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/acd854c9a7e410da68204d7b1b13b52fba9887625e9fc2b6b3eba8124f931b35.png","width":371,"height":107,"width_mm":43.47,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q09-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第9题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 排球第一次运动到 b 点的速度大小可能是第二次运动到 b 点速度大小的两倍"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 第一次击球时, 降低 a 点的高度同时仅改变击球的速度大小, 排球也可能击中 b 点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 第二次击球时, 仅改变击球的速度方向, 排球也可能击中 b 点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 击球点 a 距离地面的高度为 2.52 m"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q10","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["光学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8188126678f57ed1d14f09e4dc898d8dc8727cf604e10c71ae7e48b07d596a3e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 光学镊子是靠激光束“夹起”细胞、病毒等极其微小粒子的工具。为了简化问题，将激光束看作粒子流，其中的粒子以相同的动量沿光传播方向运动。如图所示，是一个半径为 R、折射率均匀的圆柱形玻璃砖的横截面，两束频率相同的平行激光（关于过圆心的竖直中轴线对称）相距 R 从 B、C 两点射入玻璃砖后从 A 点射出，出射光与中轴线的夹角均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知真空中的光速为 c，不考虑光的反射，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3f6a52d2c68fa69241b5ecce0f13ac13deebbcbcb113f69db9646efbdc6bde73.png","width":170,"height":239,"width_mm":19.95,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q10-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 该玻璃砖的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 两束光线对玻璃砖的合力向下"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 光在玻璃砖内运动消耗的时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{R}{c \\cdot \\tan 15^{\\circ}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 增大两平行光间的距离，两束光经玻璃折射后仍有可能从 A 点射出"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q11","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"04fa6f2c6a3f08082b82d842ceb9044ffdec0010b670d7849a6dade20f51b8e6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 下列说法正确的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 泊松亮斑是光通过小圆孔时发生的衍射现象"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 在 LC 振荡电路中, 当电流最大时, 电容器储存的电场能最小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 光电效应、康普顿效应和多普勒效应都可证明光具有粒子性"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. “浙江交通之声广播电台 FM93”, 这里的“FM93”指的是调频波 93MHz"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q12","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"46bb5b61c434c0559eb70760e6b43184c19f5a5d90b2b2caa7d59a46e0939974","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 两位同学分别拉一根长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平绳两端 "},{"type":"math","value":"A, B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，同时抖动绳子两端，使 "},{"type":"math","value":"A, B"},{"type":"text","value":" 开始在竖直方向做简谐振动，产生沿绳传播的两列波。 "},{"type":"math","value":"A, B"},{"type":"text","value":" 开始振动时开始计时， "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.3\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻，两列波恰好同时传播到 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，波形如图所示，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2d1d8e9c4c37f2ecafa178d60d708901a3096381dda8558b48851d91885cf0c8.png","width":617,"height":185,"width_mm":72.45,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第12题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. Q 点始终静止不动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"t=0.3\\ s"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻， "},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\ m<x<0.7\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的质点振动方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"t=0.35\\ s"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻， "},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\ m \\le x \\le 0.7\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的质点都处在平衡位置"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\sim 0.5 \\, s"},{"type":"text","value":" 内， "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.5 \\, m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的质点走过的路程为 "},{"type":"math","value":"35 \\, cm"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"ACD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1b93878a403152f162ab789aefb4cb9f7f9f812bef010fc00eeca72991fe899a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，真空中有一平行板电容器，两极板分别由铂和钾（其极限波长分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）制成，板的面积均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" ，板间距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现用波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda (\\lambda_1 < \\lambda < \\lambda_2)"},{"type":"text","value":" 的激光持续照射两板内表面，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3f301b92f3e24d81d6f33c3663cc03f62586b424472bf85b767e250812f74dbc.png","width":478,"height":183,"width_mm":56.07,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 稳定后铂板带负电, 钾板带正电"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 电容器最终带电量 Q 正比于 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{S}{d} \\cdot \\frac{(\\lambda - \\lambda_{1})}{\\lambda \\lambda_{1}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 保持入射激光波长不变, 增大入射激光的强度, 板间电压将增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 改用 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{0}(\\lambda_{1}<\\lambda_{0}<\\lambda)"},{"type":"text","value":" 激光照射, 板间电压将增大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","光学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0de05fdf143b478cf06eaf7319e4ad569eb31f1e6350b1a909c1691ec08c6bcc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题(Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分)\n14-I. (5 分)在某次探究小车加速度与力、质量的关系实验中, 甲、乙两组同学分别设计了如图所示的实验装置, 小车总质量用 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示, 重物质量用 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示, 不考虑细线与滑轮之间的摩擦.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/98a06bbfe638cf7e66fb2f9023a8f111ee879ec8454d0788e0dcf9e16f5b41e1.png","width":549,"height":264,"width_mm":64.47,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/97f477c784b1821171c6323ef07287259df77fcdffd3e47ec8c4a83e4c32ed74.png","width":491,"height":235,"width_mm":57.54,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/aef52b0098fa5658854dc27bd6bbb40dff60e8d1ef27f239ffba04e7d378a3c1.png","width":223,"height":217,"width_mm":26.04,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-I 题图\n(1)为了便于测量合力的大小,并得到小车总质量(未知)一定时,小车加速度与所受合力成正比的结论,甲、乙两组实验中(漏选不给分): ①必须补偿小车和长木板之间的摩擦力的实验小组是（填空）; ②实验时,必须满足“m 远小于 M”的实验小组是（填空）.\n(2)乙组同学采用乙装置完成实验时,以下操作正确的是（填空）.\nA. 补偿阻力时要移去重物和纸带\nB. 补偿阻力后若改变小车质量,不用重新补偿阻力\nC. 补偿阻力后用该装置可以完成验证系统机械能守恒定律实验\n(3)甲组同学采用甲装置完成实验时,控制小车质量不变的情况下,探究 "},{"type":"math","value":"a-F(F"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示弹簧测力计示数)关系时,没有平衡摩擦力,得到如图丙所示,图中 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1},F_{1},F_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为已知量,若已知重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" ,则本次实验中所用小车质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）. (用题中已知的物理量来表示)\n"},{"type":"math","value":"14-\\mathrm{II}"},{"type":"text","value":" . (2分)以下实验操作会给实验带来误差的是（填空）.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/341c3cf8e71f2e6ea3b11b21e2b3ee8d557989f143fe9cacf429a0d1871e85b0.png","width":196,"height":297,"width_mm":22.89,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6328f3b27fa9ac247d8ff2c98dec8db9b64b568862b65f0aa0d9fb0903a39b99.png","width":319,"height":299,"width_mm":37.38,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8793646966715cda782ec404949625c1c51c22649f034ec45dd8adae064eeb62.png","width":258,"height":251,"width_mm":30.24,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8fdefe9c2f9781f75be56848d56ed6f67faa4a72322610fbe72eb6c377cab879.png","width":235,"height":282,"width_mm":27.51,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丁\n第 14-Ⅱ题图\nA.图甲，测单摆振动周期时，选择摆球的最高点作为计时起点\nB.图乙，做平抛运动实验时，轨道槽不光滑\nC.图丙，拉橡皮筋时弹簧测力计的外壳与白纸接触有摩擦\nD.图丁，正确画好玻璃砖的界面和边界线后，实验时不小心将玻璃砖向上平移了一小段\n14-Ⅲ.(7分)小明用铜片和锌片相隔一定距离平行插入生的土豆内,制成一个简易土豆电池.为了研究该电池的电动势和内阻:\n(1)他首先用多用电表直流电压 0.5 V 挡粗测该土豆电池的电动势,将多用电表的红表笔与电池的（填空）(填“正”或“负”) 极相连,黑表笔与电池的另一电极相连,多用电表的示数如图(a)所示,则测得电源的电动势为（填空）V.\n(2)他设计了图(b)所示的电路,电路由土豆电池、电阻箱 R、电键 S、电压传感器、微电流传感器、导线组成.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7944cb36220a2b1b889979b41ba8906df62745cafd16043e3e671f010f6a2501.png","width":442,"height":248,"width_mm":51.87,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(a)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c575f0f488e5c9dcd36642cb9a6fd476d3f8fea5c3a46385db594377fec007f1.png","width":293,"height":168,"width_mm":34.23,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(b)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9af811658c2dc8f5956bd88c9b2a15ce9601f15f367052f1dd4df0fda51cf891.png","width":417,"height":256,"width_mm":53.823,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(c)\n第14-Ⅲ题图\n①图(b)中 B 是（填空）传感器；\n②实验测得的路端电压 U 与相应电流 I 的拟合图线如图(c)所示,由此得到土豆电池的电动势 E=（填空）V,内阻 r=（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":";\n③保持其它实验条件不变,仅将铜片和锌片插入得更深一些,重复上述实验,则实验得到的U-I图线可能为图(d)中的（填空）(填“甲”“乙”或“丙”);\n④该土豆电池（填空）（填“能”或“不能”）使一个“0.4 V 28 mW”的小电器正常工作.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3360866a1e6ab15d0243c6f81d029a2f38f3fc2a219938b7d4d1c247418b6650.png","width":473,"height":296,"width_mm":60.984,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅲ题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I.(1)甲、乙(1分) 乙(1分) (2)B(1分) (3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2(F_{1}-F_{0})}{a_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n解析:(1)两组实验中长木板都是水平放置,小车在长木板运动时受到长木板的摩擦力,无法测量,需要使长木板倾斜,使得重力沿长木板的分力平衡摩擦力,从而让小车受到的绳的拉力作为合外力,因此甲,乙都需要平衡摩擦力;甲能用弹簧测力计测量绳的拉力,乙不能测量绳的拉力,必须用重物的重力替代绳的拉力,所以需要满足所挂重物质量 m 远小于小车的总质量 M 的条件.\n(2) A. 补偿阻力时要移去重物,不用移去纸带,故 A 错误. B. 补偿阻力后若改变小车质量,不用重新补偿阻力,故 B 正确. C. 补偿阻力后仍有摩擦做负功,故不可用该装置完成验证系统机械能守恒定律实验,故 C 错误. 故选 B.\n(3)对小车,由牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"2F - Mg\\mu = Ma"},{"type":"text","value":", 结合图丙斜率、截距可解得"},{"type":"math","value":"M = \\frac{2(F_{1} - F_{0})}{a_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":".\n14 - II. A(2 分) A. 测单摆振动周期时, 应选择摆球的最低点作为计时起点, 故 A 会带来误差. B. 做平抛运动实验时, 轨道槽可以不光滑, 故 B 不会带来误差. C. 拉橡皮筋时弹簧测力计的外壳与白纸接触有摩擦, 不会影响实验结果, 故 C 错误. D. 正确画好玻璃砖的界面和边界线后, 实验时不小心将玻璃砖向上平移了一小段, 不会引起实验误差. 故选 A.\n14 - Ⅲ.(1)正"},{"type":"math","value":"0.290 \\pm 0.003"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)①电压 ②0.50 1300～1450 ③丙 ④不能(每空1分)\n解析:(1)多用电表电流方向“红进黑出”,故红表笔与正极相连;0.5 V量程,最小分度为0.01 V,故读数0.290 V\n(2)①A与电阻箱串联,是电流传感器,B与电阻箱是并联关系,是电压传感器.\n②根据U=E-Ir,可知,图像与纵轴的交点表示电源的电动势,图像斜率的绝对值表示电源的内阻,即"},{"type":"math","value":"E=0.50\\ \\mathrm{V}, r=\\left|\\frac{\\Delta U}{\\Delta I}\\right|=\\frac{0.50-0.34}{120\\times10^{-6}}\\ \\Omega\\approx1333\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":".\n③根据电阻定律"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\rho\\frac{L}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知,将铜片和锌片插入得更深一些,使正对面积增大,内阻减小,电源的U-I图像中斜率的绝对值表示电源的内阻,所以斜率的绝对值减小,故选图线丙.\n④“0.4 V 28 mW”的小电器正常工作时的电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{P}{U}=\\frac{28\\times10^{-3}\\mathrm{W}}{0.4\\mathrm{V}}=0.07\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，电阻为"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{U}{I}=5.7\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，将该用电器接入电路后的最大电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I'=\\frac{E}{R+r}=\\frac{0.50}{1300+5.7}\\mathrm{A}=0.00038\\mathrm{A}<0.07\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以该用电器不能正常工作."}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"76e898761ad8ab9d0f2abe3d70605c0b84e0be9d3f402f7ef79b808392740b31","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8分)如图所示,高为L的圆柱形玻璃杯底部向上凸起.把质量为m、横截面积为S的活塞放上杯口,恰好能把气体封闭在杯子里,活塞缓慢下移,当活塞下底面下降到距杯口0.2L处静止.已知外界大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=\\frac{2mg}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,忽略杯内气体温度的变化,不计活塞和杯子的摩擦,重力加速度为g.求:\n(1)活塞缓慢下移过程封闭气体对外做（填空）（填“正功”或“负功”）；\n(2) 杯子的容积 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)该过程中杯内气体向外界放出的热量 Q.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b064f74576257a5dd50496fdc3c875049022ac4ae6d3a2b284ff8f6f2b0ec3c1.png","width":375,"height":211,"width_mm":43.89,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (1)负功 (2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2}{5}SL"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{5}mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解:(1)负功 (2分)\n(2)放置重物后,假设缸内气体的压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":",根据受力平衡可得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}S = p_{0}S + mg"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1} = \\frac{3}{2}p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据玻意耳定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}(SL - V_{0}) = p_{1}(0.8SL - V_{0})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0} = \\frac{2}{5}SL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)外界对气体做功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W = (mg + p_{0}S) \\cdot \\Delta h"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"W = 0.6mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据热力学第一定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W - Q"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故气体向外界放出的热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\frac{3}{5}mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"67c25fe23fbce2a2183c0284a381a542c214ff08ea56efe78ed0ef34d9afdadd","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11分)如图所示,光滑曲面与长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=1\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平传送带AB平滑连接,传送带以v=1m/s的速度顺时针运行.质量m=1kg的小物块(可视为质点)从曲面上高h处由静止释放,小物块与传送带之间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" .传送带右侧光滑水平地面上有一个光滑的四分之一圆轨道状物体M,轨道末端与地面相切,其中质量M=2kg,R=1m.\n(1) 若 "},{"type":"math","value":"h=1 \\, m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求小物块：\n①第一次运动到 B 点的速度大小；\n②第一次冲上物体 M 后上升的最大高度 H.\n(2) 改变 h，物块冲上物体 M 后上升的最大高度 H 将发生改变。请你写出 H 与 h 的关系式。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/504bc39dd7b26039c3cad7758e3a732a1c0c6fa450185b1a0a55494b49dee919.png","width":473,"height":208,"width_mm":55.44,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(1)① 4 m/s ②"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{8}{15}"},{"type":"text","value":"m\n(2) 情况①"},{"type":"math","value":"H=\\frac{2}{3}h-\\frac{2}{15}(h>0.25\\mathrm{~m})"},{"type":"text","value":"情况②"},{"type":"math","value":"H=\\frac{1}{30}\\mathrm{m}(h\\leq 0.25\\mathrm{~m})"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解:(1)①物块下滑到 A 过程,由动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{A}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n物块滑上传送带后,在滑动摩擦力作用下匀减速运动,根据牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu mg = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a = -2\\ \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n设物块在传送带上向右始终做匀减速运动,则有"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}^{2} - v_{A}^{2} = 2aL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n代入数据解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 4\\ \\mathrm{m/s} > 1\\ \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":",假设正确.(1分)\n所以物块第一次到达 B 点速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"4\\ \\mathrm{m/s}."},{"type":"text","value":"\n②物块冲上 M 后上升到最高点达共速"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1} = (m + M)v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据能量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2} = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2} + \\frac{1}{2}Mv_{2}^{2} + mgH"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{8}{15}\\ \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(2)情况①:小物块恰好滑到 B 点共速,"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{0} - \\mu mgL = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{B}^{2} - 0"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B} = v = 1\\ \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{0} = 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n故当"},{"type":"math","value":"h > 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时,物块在传送带上一直减速,则有:\n物块从静止滑到 B 点的过程中:"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh - \\mu mgL = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1} = (m + M)v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据能量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2} = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2} + \\frac{1}{2}Mv_{2}^{2} + mgH"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立得:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{2}{3}h - \\frac{2}{15}(h > 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n情况②:经计算当物块初速度为零,经过传送带加速,运动 0.25 m 就能达共速.\n故当"},{"type":"math","value":"h < 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时,物块离开传送带一定会达共速,离开传送带的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 1\\ \\mathrm{m/s}."},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据动量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1} = (m + M)v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据能量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2} = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2} + \\frac{1}{2}Mv_{2}^{2} + mgH"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立得:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{1}{30}\\ \\mathrm{m}(h \\leq 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n综上:情况①:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{2}{3}h - \\frac{2}{15}(h > 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m})"},{"type":"text","value":"情况②:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{1}{30}\\ \\mathrm{m}(h \\leq 0.25\\ \\mathrm{m})"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"02687b91cb160420c46e37d9bd6b40352ab512e9afaf1043378fb3f2d41271e2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12分)如图甲所示(俯视图),线圈A与相距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=0.5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平光滑金属轨道MN、PO通过开关S相连,另有相同的金属轨道NQ、OC通过位于O、N左侧的一小段光滑的绝缘件与MN、PO平滑相连,在轨道右端QC接一电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=3\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" .线圈A匝数n=100匝,所围面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}=1.0\\ m^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r=2\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ,A中有截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}=0.5\\ m^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场区域D,其磁感应强度B的变化如图乙所示,t=0时刻,磁场方向垂直于线圈平面向里.MNPO区域存在 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=2\\ T"},{"type":"text","value":" 的垂直平面的匀强磁场(图中未画出);ONQC间存在垂直平面向外的磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,以O为原点,沿OC直线为x轴,ON连线为y轴建立平面直角坐标系xOy后,磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 沿x轴逐渐增强,沿y轴均匀分布.现将质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=0.2\\ kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=2\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的导体棒ab垂直放于MN、PO上,闭合开关S,棒ab向右加速达最大速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 后越过绝缘件,紧接着以 "},{"type":"math","value":"5\\ m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的加速度做匀减速直线运动.运动中导体棒与轨道接触良好,轨道足够长.求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/078dacd316590dfee5a772970f2b3780ce5702fc640c7346f64a638ca64a4023.png","width":787,"height":278,"width_mm":92.4,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7f2c2b803585f396fa7c3da5c1f199bd67996dca3eb7618d1019246a83a5a76c.png","width":269,"height":269,"width_mm":31.5,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图\n(1) 刚闭合开关 S 时导体棒 ab 的加速度大小；\n(2) 导体棒 ab 的最大速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n(3)导体棒从 x=0 运动到 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的过程中,电阻 R 产生的焦耳热;\n(4)磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 随 x 变化的函数关系式."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"12.5\\ \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"10\\ \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"3\\ \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{40}{10-x}}(\\mathrm{T})"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解:(1)由法拉第电磁感应定律,线圈A中的感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E=n\\frac{\\Delta B\\cdot S_{2}}{\\Delta t}=100\\times\\frac{0.6\\times0.5}{3}\\mathrm{V}=10\\ \\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n由闭合电路欧姆定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{E}{r + R_1} = \\frac{10\\mathrm{V}}{2\\Omega + 2\\Omega} = 2.5\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n刚闭合开关 S 时导体棒 ab 所受的安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F = B_{1}IL = 2 \\times 2.5 \\times 0.5\\ \\mathrm{N} = 2.5\\ \\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n由牛顿第二定律得，刚闭合开关 S 时导体棒 ab 的加速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{F}{m}=\\frac{2.5}{0.2}\\mathrm{m/s^{2}}=12.5\\ \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(2) 当 ab 到达最大速度时，ab 切割磁感线产生的电动势与 E 相等，所以有"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}Lv_{m}=E"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=\\frac{E}{B_{1}L}=\\frac{10}{2\\times0.5}\\ \\mathrm{m/s}=10\\ \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(3)导体棒在磁场"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"中匀减速运动，则安培力不变，\n根据牛顿第二定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A} = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A} = 1\\ \\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n导体棒从进入磁场运动 5 m 的过程中克服安培力做的功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{A} = F_{A}s = 5\\ \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据功能关系可得回路中产生的焦耳热为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}} = W_{A} = 5\\ \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电阻 R 上产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 3\\ \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)根据"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}^{2}-v^{2}=2ax"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{v_{m}^{2}-2ax}=\\sqrt{100-10x}"},{"type":"text","value":"（m/s）（1分）\n根据安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=B_{2}IL"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=B_{2}\\frac{E'}{R+R_{1}}L=\\frac{B_{2}^{2}L^{2}v}{R+R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{40}{10-x}}(\\mathrm{T})(0<x<10\\ \\mathrm{m})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(阅卷时注意关系式的多种形式 定义域没写不扣分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"13b1d96d885eab59aea8eaacf02e92b621b4ce1f3cdcabcf01a9588713cae909","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13分)碳 "},{"type":"math","value":"-14(^{14}_{6}\\mathrm{C})"},{"type":"text","value":" 是碳 "},{"type":"math","value":"-12(^{12}_{6}\\mathrm{C})"},{"type":"text","value":" 的一种同位素,具有放射性.如图甲是一个粒子检测装置的示意图,图乙为其俯视图,粒子源释放出经电离后的碳-14与碳-12原子核(初速度忽略不计),经直线加速器加速后由通道入口的中缝MN进入通道,该通道的上下表面是内半径为R、外半径为3R的半圆环,磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场垂直于半圆环,正对着通道出口处放置一张照相底片,能记录粒子从出口射出时的位置.当直线加速器的加速电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时,碳-12原子核恰好能击中照相底片的正中间位置,则:\n(1) 碳-14 具有放射性, 会发生 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":" 衰变, 请写出它的衰变方程, 并计算碳-12 原子核的比荷;\n(2)照相底片上碳-14与碳-12原子核所击中位置间的距离(结果用根号表示);\n(3)若加速电压在 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_0}{16} \\le U \\le \\frac{9U_0}{16}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间变化，求碳-12原子核在磁场中运动的最短时间.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eaadd88b9230ea9560b1a47b9c7ccef9b3cf1a0a95966964588ab68e31455265.png","width":892,"height":317,"width_mm":104.79,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-liankao-2502-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 18 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (1)"},{"type":"math","value":"^{14}_{6}\\mathrm{C}\\rightarrow^{14}_{7}\\mathrm{N}+^{0}_{-1}\\mathrm{e}\\quad \\frac{q}{m}=\\frac{U_{0}}{2R^{2}B^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=\\left(\\frac{2\\sqrt{42}}{3}-4\\right)R"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\min}=\\frac{4\\pi R^{2}B}{3U_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解:(1)碳 14 衰变成为氮 14 的过程，会放出"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"射线\n其衰变方程为"},{"type":"math","value":"^{14}_{6}\\mathrm{C}\\rightarrow^{14}_{7}\\mathrm{N}+_{-1}^{0}\\mathrm{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由题意可知当碳-12恰好能击中照相底片的正中间位置时，其运动半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r=R+R=2R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n设碳-12 经过加速后获得的速度大小为 v，根据动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"qU_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=m\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"2R=\\frac{1}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mU_{0}}{q}}"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m}=\\frac{U_{0}}{2R^{2}B^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2)设碳-12原子核和碳-14原子核经过加速后获得的速度大小分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"qU_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"qU_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times\\frac{7}{6}mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{1}B=m\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{r_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{2}B=\\frac{7}{6}m\\frac{v_{2}^{2}}{r_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=2R, r_{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{42}}{3}R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n则照相底片上碳-12 和碳-14 所击中位置间的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = 2r_{2} - 2r_{1} = \\left(\\frac{2\\sqrt{42}}{3} - 4\\right)R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)原子核在磁场中做圆周运动的半径与加速电压和比荷的关系为"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{1}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2Um}{q}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n若"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_0}{16} \\leq U \\leq \\frac{9U_0}{16}"},{"type":"text","value":", 碳-12 原子核的半径范围为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{R}{2} \\leq r \\leq \\frac{3R}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n设原子核打在内圆环上，轨迹与内圆环交于 C 点，\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"MC \\perp CO"},{"type":"text","value":"时，圆弧 MC 对应的圆心角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"最小，用时最短（1 分）\n则有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta_{\\min}=\\frac{2\\pi}{3},T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\min}=\\frac{T}{3}=\\frac{4\\pi R^{2}B}{3U_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cf39c917d72ee57043e5af92aea5a470312af13e46a255cfd36708884b6442c6.png","width":414,"height":314,"width_mm":52.5}]}}]}
